        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong><br>Discover a next-level wellness playground that blends mindful practices with playful mini-games in a sleek sci-fi interface. Journey through guided chakra alignment, cosmic arcade challenges, weather simulations, and customizable soundscapes—all designed to center your mind and spark joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MediDrive Engine</strong> – Advanced biofeedback and quantum resonance guide you through chakra-alignment sessions with adaptive light and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HoloSphere Arcade</strong> – Zero-gravity mini-games (Golf, Billiards, Pong, Basketball) fused with ambient soundscapes to turn play into a meditative ritual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PrecipiTech Engine</strong> – Dial in rainfall intensity, thunder and lightning effects, and layered atmospherics for instant calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ChromaTone Generator</strong> – Sculpt your perfect soundscape by mixing color noise (white, pink, brown, blue, etc.), soothing effects, and curated playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beta Basement Demo</strong> – Unlock hidden Easter eggs to sample our rough-around-the-edges Flight Simulator, Driving module, Party Simulator, and Keys station—glitches and all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong><br>Whether you need a moment of deep relaxation or a burst of joyful distraction, this all-in-one experience adapts to your state of mind. Track your progress with in-app analytics, personalize every session, and explore unreleased prototypes for a peek at what’s next. Perfect for meditation enthusiasts, casual gamers, and anyone craving a futuristic twist on self-care.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong><br>Discover a next-level wellness playground that blends mindful practices with playful mini-games in a sleek sci-fi interface. Journey through guided chakra alignment, cosmic arcade challenges, weather simulations, and customizable soundscapes—all designed to center your mind and spark joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MediDrive Engine</strong> – Advanced biofeedback and quantum resonance guide you through chakra-alignment sessions with adaptive light and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HoloSphere Arcade</strong> – Zero-gravity mini-games (Golf, Billiards, Pong, Basketball) fused with ambient soundscapes to turn play into a meditative ritual.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PrecipiTech Engine</strong> – Dial in rainfall intensity, thunder and lightning effects, and layered atmospherics for instant calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ChromaTone Generator</strong> – Sculpt your perfect soundscape by mixing color noise (white, pink, brown, blue, etc.), soothing effects, and curated playlists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beta Basement Demo</strong> – Unlock hidden Easter eggs to sample our rough-around-the-edges Flight Simulator, Driving module, Party Simulator, and Keys station—glitches and all.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love It</strong><br>Whether you need a moment of deep relaxation or a burst of joyful distraction, this all-in-one experience adapts to your state of mind. Track your progress with in-app analytics, personalize every session, and explore unreleased prototypes for a peek at what’s next. Perfect for meditation enthusiasts, casual gamers, and anyone craving a futuristic twist on self-care.</p>",
        "short_description": "A sci-fi wellness playground that invites you to balance mind and body through guided chakra sessions, zero-G arcade mini-games, dynamic rain &amp; thunder simulations, and customizable color-noise soundscapes.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
